QingRead / 阅简
App source is independently implemented. Architecture references are recorded
in docs/REFERENCE_AUDIT.md. No reference repository source is vendored.

Direct dependencies:
Readium Swift Toolkit 3.11.1 — BSD-3-Clause
SwiftSoup 2.13.5 — MIT

SPM resolution is locked in Package.resolved. Exact upstream license texts for
all resolved packages are in QingRead/Resources/Notices and shipped in the App.
The resolved package graph also contains optional libraries which are not linked
by the chosen Readium products; their notices are conservatively included.
Readium's own bundled assets retain their notices inside the package resource
bundles. No DRM unlocking, server dependency, external AI service, or bundled
third-party novel is included.

All text and SVG content in OriginalFixture.epub was created for this project's
tests and is covered by this project's MIT license.

DifferenceKit 1.3.0 — Apache License 2.0, copyright Ryo Aoyama / ra1028.
The upstream repository at the locked revision contains no NOTICE file. Its
unmodified LICENSE text is reproduced in differencekit-LICENSE.txt.

Noto Serif SC — Copyright 2012 Google Inc.; SIL Open Font License 1.1.
The complete variable font is bundled unchanged, with the original family name.
Font origin revision and SHA256 are recorded in docs/font-lock.json.
